  {
    "insert": "\n"
  },
  {
    "insert": "The concept of the engagement learning paths, gamification, and LLM-based tutoring systems lacks fluidity. The connection between them has not been illustrated thoroughly. The introduction of the approach can be moved to the motivation to enhance the fluidity.",
    "attributes": {
      "color": "#000000",
      "background": "transparent"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "To remove people with experience with LLMs or gaming frequency might not be an ideal choice. There is no guarantee they can learn better than other students. It also depends on how the game is designed in this project.",
    "attributes": {
      "color": "#000000",
      "background": "transparent"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "The methodology design needs further elaboration. For instance, it lacks some details about what courses or learning tasks will be used for evaluation. The design of LLM-based Personalized Adaptive Tutors is not described clearly. To improve it, you can give specific learning tasks and the details of the designed LLM-based tutors.",
    "attributes": {
      "color": "#000000",
      "background": "transparent"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
